          'Music videos: flagship content, professionally shot, each one a statement piece',
          'Dance practice videos: within 48 hours of every MV — the "proof of skill" content',
          'Behind-the-scenes making films: 15-20 minute documentaries of the MV/album process',
          'Member content: individual or duo vlogs, Q&As, "day in the life"',
          'Performance videos: KCON stages, music show performances, special stages',
